not rotated.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRotate a control node 90 degrees and set its anchors so that it will have to be dynamically resized on one edge of the parent. Resize the parent node. (See above video). \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP:\n[rotated_control_anchors_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17913011/rotated_control_anchors_mrp.zip)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99703/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99703/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}